{
  "source": "Prompts/build-your-skills-opener-8.mp4",
  "duration": 199.8309375,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.62,
      "text": "AI tools will constantly evolve, update, and eventually be replaced,"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.2,
      "end": 9.16,
      "text": "but the underlying skills you build while using them are permanent."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.14,
      "end": 12.18,
      "text": "Think back to when you first learned how to ride a bicycle."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.08,
      "end": 15.92,
      "text": "Over time, you physically outgrew that childhood frame"
    },
    {
      "start": 15.92,
      "end": 18.88,
      "text": "and moved on to a completely different, faster bike."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.58,
      "end": 21.7,
      "text": "But you didn't have to start learning from scratch."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.68,
      "end": 25.58,
      "text": "That is exactly because your time on that very first bike"
    },
    {
      "start": 25.58,
      "end": 28.86,
      "text": "taught you an invisible permanent skill, balance."
    },
    {
      "start": 29.94,
      "end": 32.4,
      "text": "That core physical awareness made you a better cyclist,"
    },
    {
      "start": 33.0,
      "end": 35.94,
      "text": "and it translated directly into entirely different movements,"
    },
    {
      "start": 36.26,
      "end": 39.4,
      "text": "like skating or going up for a layup on the basketball court."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.28,
      "end": 42.44,
      "text": "Whether you went on to become a dedicated athlete"
    },
    {
      "start": 42.44,
      "end": 44.56,
      "text": "or just rode your bike for fun on the weekends,"
    },
    {
      "start": 45.06,
      "end": 47.86,
      "text": "that acquired coordination stayed with you permanently."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.98,
      "end": 51.2,
      "text": "Nobody could install that ability into your brain"
    },
    {
      "start": 51.2,
      "end": 52.62,
      "text": "or simply hand it to you."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.62,
      "end": 55.32,
      "text": "You had to put in the physical practice to build it."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.26,
      "end": 60.34,
      "text": "Now you face the exact same requirement with the mental tools of the AI era."
    },
    {
      "start": 61.26,
      "end": 65.0,
      "text": "Moving past physical coordination, we are going to focus on the mental habits"
    },
    {
      "start": 65.0,
      "end": 66.76,
      "text": "you strengthen through active practice,"
    },
    {
      "start": 67.14,
      "end": 70.34,
      "text": "specifically thinking carefully and working alongside other people."
    },
    {
      "start": 71.12,
      "end": 74.52,
      "text": "You also need to train yourself to actively hunt for alternative ideas"
    },
    {
      "start": 74.52,
      "end": 76.94,
      "text": "and maintain a relentless state of curiosity."
    },
    {
      "start": 77.78,
      "end": 80.88,
      "text": "You will use AI as the practice dummy for these habits,"
    },
    {
      "start": 80.88,
      "end": 85.78,
      "text": "but the cognitive endurance you develop applies directly to your schoolwork,"
    },
    {
      "start": 86.16,
      "end": 87.9,
      "text": "your career, and your daily life."
    },
    {
      "start": 88.8,
      "end": 93.48,
      "text": "Very soon, accessing a high-powered AI will not give you a competitive edge."
    },
    {
      "start": 94.2,
      "end": 98.18,
      "text": "Every single person in the room will have the exact same software on their device."
    },
    {
      "start": 98.88,
      "end": 101.16,
      "text": "When the technology is a universal constant,"
    },
    {
      "start": 101.78,
      "end": 104.6,
      "text": "your personal choices, your specific questions,"
    },
    {
      "start": 105.14,
      "end": 108.66,
      "text": "and your independent judgment become the only variables that matter."
    },
    {
      "start": 108.66,
      "end": 113.7,
      "text": "This roadmap shows what will explore in this section to build those essential abilities."
    },
    {
      "start": 114.7,
      "end": 117.48,
      "text": "We start with step number one, judgment and responsibility."
    },
    {
      "start": 118.56,
      "end": 120.92,
      "text": "This requires you to practice questioning claims,"
    },
    {
      "start": 121.68,
      "end": 123.9,
      "text": "weighing evidence, using AI honestly,"
    },
    {
      "start": 124.44,
      "end": 126.2,
      "text": "and protecting the information you share,"
    },
    {
      "start": 126.56,
      "end": 129.42,
      "text": "all while considering who your choices actually affect."
    },
    {
      "start": 130.26,
      "end": 133.58,
      "text": "Step two focuses on people skills and creative thinking."
    },
    {
      "start": 134.3,
      "end": 137.2,
      "text": "Here you practice listening, communicating clearly,"
    },
    {
      "start": 137.2,
      "end": 140.48,
      "text": "and collaborating with others so you can explore different ideas"
    },
    {
      "start": 140.48,
      "end": 142.82,
      "text": "and find better approaches to complex problems."
    },
    {
      "start": 143.82,
      "end": 147.2,
      "text": "Finally, step three is curiosity and your next steps."
    },
    {
      "start": 147.88,
      "end": 150.66,
      "text": "This is where you learn to follow a line of questioning to its end,"
    },
    {
      "start": 151.18,
      "end": 152.58,
      "text": "dig deeper into your own interests,"
    },
    {
      "start": 153.08,
      "end": 156.58,
      "text": "and identify a concrete, actionable next step you can take."
    },
    {
      "start": 157.16,
      "end": 162.34,
      "text": "Moving through this three-part process is how you develop the kind of enduring expertise"
    },
    {
      "start": 162.34,
      "end": 164.78,
      "text": "that survives the next software update."
    },
    {
      "start": 164.78,
      "end": 166.8,
      "text": "As we go through this curriculum,"
    },
    {
      "start": 167.46,
      "end": 170.24,
      "text": "there is one critical question you need to keep in mind."
    },
    {
      "start": 170.94,
      "end": 172.66,
      "text": "Remember that in the near future,"
    },
    {
      "start": 173.04,
      "end": 177.0,
      "text": "everyone around you will possess the exact same technological capabilities."
    },
    {
      "start": 177.9,
      "end": 182.48,
      "text": "So what unique value do you bring to the equation that the machine does not?"
    },
    {
      "start": 183.14,
      "end": 185.6,
      "text": "These upcoming lessons are not a software tutorial."
    },
    {
      "start": 186.26,
      "end": 190.7,
      "text": "They are the practical process of building your personal answer to that exact question."
    },
    {
      "start": 190.7,
      "end": 193.8,
      "text": "The simple truth is that the tools will change,"
    },
    {
      "start": 194.46,
      "end": 196.26,
      "text": "but the skills are yours to keep."
    }
  ],
